**`Target platform` is one of `jena` · `databricks` · `fabric` · `undecided`.**
It is the one field the ontology compiler reads to pick a target, so it is a
value and not a sentence. Today `jena` and `databricks` are built; `fabric` is
configured but not implemented.

**Choose it from the competency questions, not from precedent.** A triple store
earns its place where relationship traversal and per-fact provenance are the
point. Where the questions are aggregations over known joins, a warehouse with
a semantic model on top is less machinery for the same answer. If the questions
are not written yet, the honest answer is `undecided`.

